bzip2: reading and writing of bzip2 compressed files and strings, with
the bzip2 library of the base system.

The module bz2 of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20210902/bz2.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its headers in
include/php81/php/ext/bz2.
